	abstract = {
		We present an overview of Lab's 2024 Task 3, which is part of CLEF-2024. Task 3 focuses on building models capable of detecting 23 persuasion techniques at text-span level in online media. The task covers 5 languages, namely, Bulgarian, English, Portuguese, Russian and Slovene and highly-debated topics in the media, e.g., Isreali-Palestine conflict, Ukraine-Russia war, climate change, Covid-19, abortion, etc. 23 teams registered to the task, while 2 of them submitted system responses which were compared against a baseline and Task organizers' system using
